        code: "def allPathsSourceTarget(graph):\n    target = len(graph) - 1\n    res = []\n    queue = [[0]]\n    while queue:\n        path = queue.pop(0)\n        node = path[-1]\n        if node == target:\n            res.append(list(path))\n            continue\n        for nxt in sorted(graph[node] if node < len(graph) else []):\n            if nxt not in path:\n                queue.append(path + [nxt])\n    res.sort()\n    return res\n",
